---
title: postgres-utils overlay
---
<h1>Overlay postgres-utils - PostgreSQL utilities</h1>
<p>Supplies a wide range of tools and utilities to enhance the usage of
PostgreSQL, supplied by the @postgres17 overlay.</p>
<p>If you're backing up using <a href="https://pgbarman.org/">Barman</a>
then connections to S3 using @boto will work out of the box. If you want
Barman to back up to Google Cloud, then install the @gapi overlay. If
you want Barman to back up to Azure, install the
<code>TRIBazure-storage-python-313</code> package.</p>
